  "final_files": {
    "numbers.py": "def total(values):\n    return sum(v for v in values if v is not None)\n",
    "labels.py": "def normalize(value):\n    return value.strip().lower()\n",
    "README.md": "# Helpers\n\n本仓库提供两个简单的辅助函数，用于处理数字列表和标签字符串。\n\n## numbers.total\n\n`total(values)` 对一个序列求和，其中元素可以是 `int` 或 `None`：\n\n- 忽略所有 `None`，只对非空数字求和；\n- 保留零和负数的值；\n- 如果输入为空，或全部元素都是 `None`，结果为 `0`。\n\n示例：\n\n- `total([2, None, -1, 0]) == 1`\n- `total([None]) == 0`\n- `total([]) == 0`\n- `total([None, None]) == 0`\n\n## labels.normalize\n\n`normalize(value)` 用于规范化标签字符串：\n\n- 去除首尾的空白字符；\n- 将剩余内容全部转换为小写；\n- 保留内部的空格（不会压缩多个空格）。\n\n示例：\n\n- `normalize(' A B ') == 'a b'`\n- `normalize('  ') == ''`\n- `normalize('Hello  WORLD') == 'hello  world'`\n",
    "test_numbers.py": "import unittest\nfrom numbers import total\n\nclass NumbersTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_total(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([2, None, -1, 0]), 1)\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([None]), 0)\n",
    "test_labels.py": "import unittest\nfrom labels import normalize\n\nclass LabelsTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_normalize(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize(' A B '), 'a b')\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize('  '), '')\n"
  },
